{
  "Items.WolfPepper.Desc": "A shiny black pepper. Its shape is bulbous at the base, but long and narrow at the tip, with a fuzzy feel to it. It's similar, but not quite the same as the usual canine peppers you'd find, and it smells quite spicy."
  "Items.WolfPepper.Long": "a wolf pepper"
  "Items.WolfPepper.Short": "Wolf Pepper"
  // 原版 WolfPepper.hx 效果文案
  "Items.WolfPepper.Eat": "The pepper has an uncomfortable texture to it, being covered in soft fuzz like it's a peach but somewhat crunchy like any other pepper. Its spiciness makes you nearly spit it out, and you're left sniffling after."
  "Items.WolfPepper.ExtraRipe": " Maybe it was a bit too spicy... The pepper seemed far more ripe than what you'd expect."
  "Items.WolfPepper.LickLips": "[pg]You lick your lips after you finish. That spiciness hit you in more ways than one."
  "Items.WolfPepper.ToughCrit": "[pg]You roll your shoulders and tense your arms experimentally. You feel more durable, and your blood seems to run through you more clearly. You know you have more endurance."
  "Items.WolfPepper.Tough": "[pg]Your muscles feel denser and more durable. Not so much that feel stronger, but you feel like you can take more hits."
  "Items.WolfPepper.SlowCrit": "[pg]The pepper's strong taste makes you take a couple steps back and lean against the nearest solid object. You don't feel like you'll be moving very fast anymore."
  "Items.WolfPepper.Slow": "[pg]You stumble forward, but manage to catch yourself. Still, though, you feel somewhat slower."
  "Items.WolfPepper.Smart1": "[pg]The spiciness makes your head twirl, but you manage to gather yourself. A strange sense of clarity comes over you in the aftermath, and you feel "
  "Items.WolfPepper.SmartCrit": "a lot "
  "Items.WolfPepper.Smart2": "smarter somehow."
  "Items.WolfPepper.HornsCrumble": "[pg]You feel your horns crumble, falling apart in large chunks until they flake away into nothing."
  "Items.WolfPepper.FinGone": "[pg]A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into your spine. After a moment the pain passes, though your fin is gone!"
  "Items.WolfPepper.WingsGone": "[pg]A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into each of your shoulder-blades. After a moment the pain passes, though your wings are gone!"
  "Items.WolfPepper.HumanTongue": "[pg]You lick the roof of your mouth, noticing that your tongue feels different. It then hits you-- <b>You have a human tongue!</b>"
  "Items.WolfPepper.SandTrapEyes": "[pg]You feel a twinge in your eyes and you blink. It feels like black cataracts have just fallen away from you, and you know without needing to see your reflection that your eyes have gone back to looking human."
  "Items.WolfPepper.Eyes1": "[pg]You blink and stumble, a wave of vertigo threatening to pull your [feet] from under you. As you steady and open your eyes, you realize something seems different. Your vision is changed somehow."
  "Items.WolfPepper.ArachnidEyesGone": " Your arachnid eyes are gone!"
  "Items.WolfPepper.Eyes2": " <b>You have normal, human eyes.</b>"
